            <ArticleTitle>Pseudo-candy wrapper: bifocal radial artery graft spasm following stent implantation.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>201-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We encountered a case of intractable radial artery graft spasm after stent implantation which was partially responsive to nominal nitroglycerin therapy. We report this case with intravascular ultrasound imaging at the radial artery spasm site.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
